OL,3,AJagtar Singh Johal granted bail nine
OL,4,Ayears after being detained in India
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Scottish Sikh activist who has been
OL,7,Flocked up in India for almost nine
OL,8,Fyears without conviction has been
OL,9,Fgranted bail.
OL,11,FJagtar Singh Johal, from Dumbarton, was
OL,12,Farrested and detained in 2017 in
OL,13,Fconnection with alleged terror
OL,14,Foffences.
OL,16,FThe Indian authorities have accused him
OL,17,Fof having a role in a series of
OL,18,Ftargeted killings of religious and
OL,19,Fpolitical figures.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
