OL,3,AJagtar Singh Johal granted bail nine
OL,4,Ayears after being detained in India
OL,5,
OL,6,FHis family said they were still waiting
OL,7,Ffor the details of what will happen
OL,8,Fnext but are "relieved" by the Indian
OL,9,Fcourt's decision.
